offset 0:  byte_length (4)
offset 4:  max_byte_length (4)
offset 8:  detached (1)
offset 9:  shared (1)
offset 10: padding (6)
offset 16: data pointer (8) <- TARGET
offset 24: array_list.next (8)
offset 32: array_list.prev (8)
offset 40: opaque (8)
offset 48: free_func (8)
```

